    "pit_derivation": "Each saved forecast with a count law per target day draws its uniforms from numpy.random.default_rng(pulsegraph.random.derived_seed(20260916, component, domain, series_id, cutoff, horizon, model)), the same SHA-256 derivation with the cutoff as the run's string label; V = rng.random(horizon), one uniform per target day in lead order. U = F(y-) + V (F(y) - F(y-)) with F(y-) = 1 - SF(y - 1) and F(y) = 1 - SF(y) of the saved law. Ten equal bins on [0, 1], the last closed. Raw native deciles, local_mean_28 and autoets_weekly have no full count law, and their PIT is unavailable.",
